        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn, Stainless Steel Hand Made Mortise Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAs beautiful as it is timeless, Acorn's mortise cylinder lockset is forged by hand using the traditional techniques of the hammer and anvil. The arched plates will look great in almost any decor, be it traditional, rustic, or even natural contemporary. During the forging process, the stainless steel finish darkens in an uneven pattern that is similar to antique nickel or pewter.  It is available in single cylinder and dummy functions. The Stainless Steel Mortise Handleset is for 1-3/4\" thick doors with a 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Stainless Steel Mortise Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 7-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/2” minimum.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Blank trim for non-working doors that does not have a turnpiece or a cylinder. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a lever from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Door Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Due to the handmade craftsman nature of this product, all dimensions are approximate. DO NOT DRILL ANY HOLES until you have the actual pieces to be mounted.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Hand Made Mortise Handleset, Acorn KT2JI",
                "description": "Acorn KT2JI - As beautiful as it is timeless, Acorn's mortise cylinder lockset is forged by hand using the traditional techniques of the hammer and anvil. The arched plates will look great in almost any decor, be it traditional, rustic, or even natural contemporary. During the forging process, the stainless steel finish darkens in an uneven pattern that is similar to antique nickel or pewter.  It is available in single cylinder and dummy functions. ",
                "keywords": "ACO-KT2JI Stainless Steel Hand Made Mortise Handlesets, Acorn exterior entry sets with mortise cylinder locks, mortise handlesets, stainless steel handlesets, mortise locks, mortise handlesets, acorn iron art handlesets, Stainless Steel  Locksets, Stainless Steel Mortise Handlesets, Hand Made Front Door Locksets, ACO-KT1JI, Acorn KT1JI, Acorn KT1JD, Acorn KT2JI, Acorn KT2JD,"
